What I do is have a batch file that will copy a personalised
defaults.nh
file to the appropriate place if it exists.  This way I can setup my
knights one way and my wizards another.

Since it's so small I'll list the batch file here.

---- 8< ----- CUT HERE ---- 8< ----- ---- 8< ----- CUT HERE ---- 8<
-----
IF EXIST %1.nh move defaults.nh backup.nh
IF EXIST %1.nh move %1.nh defaults.nh
nethack -u %1 %2 %3 %4 %5
IF EXIST backup.nh move defaults.nh %1.nh
IF EXIST backup.nh move backup.nh defaults.nh
